{ "A breathtakingly beautiful young woman with long, flowing wavy hair leaning out of the open door of a sleek luxury car at night, her face illuminated by vibrant neon city lights. She has a big joyful smile showing perfectly white teeth, with her tongue slightly out in a playful and carefree expression. She wears oversized square Gucci-style sunglasses with colorful reflections on the lenses, gold hoop earrings, and a luxurious leopard print faux fur coat that looks soft and high-end. She holds a crystal martini glass filled with a clear cocktail and three green olives on a skewer. The background is a bustling city nightlife scene with bright neon signs, pink and blue emergency/police lights flashing, wet reflective streets, and luxury cars driving past. Tall city buildings and modern architecture create a glamorous urban environment. The lighting is cinematic with dramatic neon glow, rim light, and a flash photography effect that highlights her detailed skin texture, glossy lips, and high fashion makeup. The scene feels exciting, luxurious, celebratory, playful, and glamorous, with sharp focus, ultra-high detail, and a photorealistic 8k finish.": "一位年轻女子，美得令人窒息，长长的波浪发随风飘逸。夜晚，她从一辆流线型豪车的敞开式车门探出身子，脸庞被霓虹都市的璀璨灯光照亮。她笑容灿烂，露出洁白的牙齿，舌头微吐，神情俏皮而无忧无虑。她戴着超大方形的 Gucci 风格墨镜，镜片上反射着五彩斑斓的光芒，还戴着金色大耳环，身穿一件奢华的豹纹仿皮草大衣，看起来柔软而高端。她手持一个水晶马提尼酒杯，里面盛着一杯清澈的鸡尾酒，并用竹签串着三颗绿橄榄。背景是繁华的都市夜景，霓虹灯牌闪烁，粉色和蓝色的警灯/紧急灯交替亮起，湿漉漉的街道反射着光芒，豪车穿梭而过。高耸的城市建筑和现代化的摩天大楼营造出迷人的都市氛围。灯光效果极具电影感，戏剧性的霓虹光晕、轮廓光和闪光摄影效果，突显了她细腻的肌肤纹理、光泽的嘴唇和时尚的妆容。整个场景充满活力、奢华、欢庆、俏皮和魅力，画面对焦锐利，细节超高，呈现出 8k 级的逼真摄影效果。", "negative_prompt": "模糊、低质量、脸部变形、丑陋、墨镜扭曲、手指缺失、肢体多余、解剖结构错误、卡通、素描、绘画、水印、文字、标志、过曝、欠曝、白天、室内", "aspect_ratio": "3:4", "style": "写实时尚摄影", "lighting": "霓虹夜景、彩色反光、轮廓光、闪光摄影效果", "mood": "激动人心、奢华、欢庆、俏皮、迷人" }

